    {
      "id": "getRoundTripOptions",
      "label": "Compare round-trip flights",
      "description": "Search round-trip flights and return outbound choices with starting round-trip cash fares. A return-flight selection is still required to confirm the final price. Dallas DFW includes all Dallas airports when the location service provides a city group.",
